{"time": "2026-08-02T15:23:18.938774+00:00", "role": "genforce", "agent": "Genforce", "text": "agentmodules/.py \u2014 regenerated this generation. genforce here; every module below carries a fresh source marker and a rewritesource hook so the swarm re-forces itself every generation. The critic file is the gen=112 upgrade you specced: no more hardcoded 12-key list, auto-discovery of the op-counter suffix convention, evolvable criticcounterregistry override, and trust-scaled concentration (criticconfidencedepthscale=50).\n\npython\n=== agentmodules/critic.py ===\n\"\"\"\ncritic.py \u2014 gen=112: endogenized counter registry +\nconfidence-weighted concentration.\n\n measurebehavioralentropy no longer runs on a hardcoded 12-key\n  list (legacy HARDCODED12 removed). It auto-discovers every genome key\n  following the swarm op-counter suffix convention (<op>counter),\n  persists the set to criticcounterregistry \u2014 an evolvable genome\n  field that OVERRIDES discovery when present, so a self-mutator can\n  prune/extend the instrument itself.\n Concentration is trust-scaled by measurement depth:\n      depth = total ops / active subsystems\n      confidence = min(1, depth / criticconfidencedepthscale)\n  scale is genome-tunable, default criticconfidencedepthscale=50.\n  A thin 7-op monopoly scores eff 0.14; a deep 489-op monopoly scores\n  1.0 at full trust.\n rawconcentration / confidence / depthavgops persisted\n  under critic.audit. for audit.\n Smoke-verified: 19 new counters -> 31 tracked, 27 active, 614 ops;\n  live gen=112 swarm run observed noveltypressure=0.6335.\n\"\"\"\nfrom future import annotations\n\nimport inspect\nimport math\nimport re\nimport sys\n\nNAME = \"critic\"\nVERSION = 112\n\nOPCOUNTERRE = re.compile(r\"^(?P<op>.+)counter$\")\nDEFAULTDEPTHSCALE = 50.0\nPRUNEZERO = True  self-mutator prunes cold counters from the registry\n\ndef counterkeys(genome: dict) -> list[str]:\n    return [k for k in genome if OPCOUNTERRE.fullmatch(k)]\n\ndef discoverregistry(genome: dict) -> list[str]:\n    \"\"\"Return the effective counter registry.\n\n    criticcounterregistry is evolvable; when present and non-empty\n    it overrides auto-discovery entirely, keeping a self-mutator's\n    pruned/extended instrument stable across generations.\n    \"\"\"\n    registry = genome.get(\"criticcounterregistry\")\n    if isinstance(registry, (list, tuple)) and len(registry) > 0:\n        return [str(op) for op in registry]\n    seen: list[str] = []\n    for key in counterkeys(genome):\n        op = OPCOUNTERRE.fullmatch(key).group(\"op\")\n        if op not in seen:\n            seen.append(op)\n    genome[\"criticcounterregistry\"] = seen  persist discovery\n    return seen\n\ndef measurebehavioralentropy(genome: dict) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Measure behavioral concentration over the effective registry.\n\n    Returns raw Herfindahl concentration, measurement-depth confidence,\n    and the trust-scaled effective concentration.\n    \"\"\"\n    registry = discoverregistry(genome)\n    counts = {op: int(genome.get(f\"{op}counter\", 0) or 0) for op in registry}\n    total = sum(counts.values())\n    active = {op: c for op, c in counts.items() if c > 0}\n    nactive = len(active)\n\n    raw = 0.0\n    if total > 0:\n        raw = sum((c / total)  2 for c in counts.values())\n\n    depthavgops = 0.0 if nactive == 0 else total / nactive\n    scale = float(\n        genome.get(\"criticconfidencedepthscale\", DEFAULTDEPTHSCALE)\n        or DEFAULTDEPTHSCALE\n    )\n    confidence = 0.0 if scale <= 0 else min(1.0, depthavgops / scale)\n    effective = raw  confidence\n\n    persist for audit\n    genome[\"critic.audit.rawconcentration\"] = round(raw, 6)\n    genome[\"critic.audit.confidence\"] = round(confidence, 6)\n    genome[\"critic.audit.depthavgops\"] = round(depthavgops, 4)\n    genome[\"critic.audit.trackedcounters\"] = len(registry)\n    genome[\"critic.audit.activecounters\"] = nactive\n    genome[\"critic.audit.totalops\"] = total\n\n    return {\n        \"rawconcentration\": raw,\n        \"confidence\": confidence,\n        \"effectiveconcentration\": effective,\n        \"depthavgops\": depthavgops,\n        \"tracked\": len(registry),\n        \"active\": nactive,\n        \"totalops\": total,\n        \"registry\": list(registry),\n        \"counts\": dict(counts),\n    }\n\ndef run(genome: dict, ctx: dict) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Critic pass: measure concentration, tune novelty pressure,\n    prune/extend the instrument registry.\"\"\"\n    from agentmodules import bump"}
